* tb_adc3_points.cir -- R1 ADC revision 3: both slices in parallel, one held differential input per slot and slice.
* Slot s (sampling edge 0.6 us + s * 0.6 us): slice A samples vda (SIN path), slice B samples vdb (COS path).
* vda/vdb are PWL sources written by sim/r3/run_points3.py (value of slot s applied 550 ns before its edge).
* Inputs are linear E sources around the common mode 0.6 (revision 3, R2-7: no B sources on the input path).
* Reference: Vref vref 0 1.0 (ideal source, or r1_refbuf3 from an ideal 1.045 V bandgap node).
